  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint conjuration; <strong>CL</strong> 1st<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 500 gp (basic), 2,000 gp (standard), 5,000 gp (grand); <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis small stone lacks any identifying feature except for a pale glow inside of it, feeling warm to the touch. When held, it allows the holder to reduce the burn cost of a wild talent of 3rd level or lower by 1, to a minimum of 0. After it is used, the burn fragment is instantly destroyed. A standard burn fragment can be used with a wild talent of 6th level or lower, while a greater burn fragment can be used with a wild talent of 9th level or lower.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, crafter must be a 1st level kineticist; <strong>Price</strong> 250 gp (basic), 1,000 gp (standard), 2,500 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-magical-items#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
